  "activity_sections": [
    {
      "key": "cf72b6bf-dc37-4a88-b413-af014cf15508",
      "position": 1,
      "properties": {
        "description": "Try out the student activity on your own or watch the Teacher Prep Video to preview the activity.\n\nFeel confident and prepared as you start teaching the lesson. Click here to start learning!",
        "tips": [
          {
            "type": "teachingTip",
            "markdown": "We recommend that [create a classroom section](https://support.code.org/hc/en-us/articles/115000488132-Creating-a-Class-Section) and assign the [Hour of AI: Mix and Move with AI](https://studio.code.org/courses/mix-move-ai-2025/units/1/lessons/1/levels/1) to your students. This will allow you to track student progress. However, you can also send students to Mix & Move with AI Activity directly to complete the activity without logging in."
          }
        ]
      },
      "seeding_key": {
        "activity_section.key": "cf72b6bf-dc37-4a88-b413-af014cf15508",
        "lesson_activity.key": "5aebe064-275e-4898-b1d7-07afbdd6b201"
      }
    },
    {
      "key": "ed196ddd-d230-4c5d-aeff-382e33502524",
      "position": 1,
      "properties": {
        "description": "  <i class=\"fa fa-check-square-o\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i> <strong>Do This:</strong> Begin with a discussion opportunity to help students activate prior knowledge and to set the tone for this fun, exploratory lesson.\n\n <i class=\"fa fa-comments\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i> <strong>Discuss:</strong> What would you ask AI to create if it could make anything? \n\n***Or***  If AI could help you create a song, what would you want it to sound like?",
        "tips": [
          {
            "type": "teachingTip",
            "markdown": "Option to choose an alternative question that is most appropriate for your students:\n- What’s something you’ve heard about AI?\n- Where have you seen AI used in your daily life?\n- How do you think AI “learns” new things?\n- What’s something you’re curious about when it comes to AI?\n- Do you feel excited, nervous, or unsure about using AI? Why?"
          }
        ]
      },
      "seeding_key": {
        "activity_section.key": "ed196ddd-d230-4c5d-aeff-382e33502524",
        "lesson_activity.key": "cc2e2f63-914d-4169-bf32-5c3c0a292f5d"
      }
    },
    {
      "key": "898a3460-793e-4acf-a17f-c7b717558a9f",
      "position": 2,
      "properties": {
        "description": "<i class=\"fa fa-check-square-o\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i> <strong>Do This:</strong> Introduce the lesson objectives and the Question of the Day: How can we create with AI?\n"
      },
      "seeding_key": {
        "activity_section.key": "898a3460-793e-4acf-a17f-c7b717558a9f",
        "lesson_activity.key": "cc2e2f63-914d-4169-bf32-5c3c0a292f5d"
      }
    },
    {
      "key": "da6547ed-29ef-4288-b18b-86a7bad73bb8",
      "position": 1,
      "properties": {
        "description": "\n\n<i class=\"fa fa-microphone\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i> <strong>Say:</strong> Today we’re taking part in a global movement to learn more about AI. The Hour of AI is an event that helps students of all ages across the whole world take their first step from watchers to creators.\n\nIn the next hour, you will explore how you can work with AI to generate images and code for music and dance moves.\n\n<i class=\"fa fa-check-square-o\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i> <strong>Do This:</strong> Preview or review the key vocabulary:\n- **artificial intelligence (AI):** a technology that mimics human intelligence, performing tasks such as understanding language, recognizing patterns, and making decisions\n- **prompt:** the instruction or question you give to AI that tell it what to do\n- **generate:** to make or create something\n- **code:** a set of instructions that tells a computer what to do\n\n<i class=\"fa fa-check-square-o\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i> <strong>Do This:</strong> Watch the video on the first level as a class. \n",
        "name": "Intro to Mix & Move with AI",
        "progression_name": "Intro"
      },
      "seeding_key": {
        "activity_section.key": "da6547ed-29ef-4288-b18b-86a7bad73bb8",
        "lesson_activity.key": "5471cfa4-2135-4972-aca6-c67c5aed326b"
      }
    },
    {
      "key": "27e3b1ec-e707-4d18-a72f-27749025d8a8",
      "position": 2,
      "properties": {
        "description": "<i class=\"fa fa-check-square-o\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i> <strong>Do This:</strong> Transition students to work at their own pace through the activity.\n\n<i class=\"fa fa-refresh\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i> <strong>Circulate:</strong> During the activity you can circulate and ask students some of the following questions:\n- What are you changing in the prompt and how does it affect what the AI generates?\n- What have you done to change or modify what the code the AI generated?\n- What choices are you making as the creator right now?\n- If you could make the output different, what would you change?\n\nWhile students are working through the activity, encourage them to share what they’re making with each other."
      },
      "seeding_key": {
        "activity_section.key": "27e3b1ec-e707-4d18-a72f-27749025d8a8",
        "lesson_activity.key": "5471cfa4-2135-4972-aca6-c67c5aed326b"
      }
    },
    {
      "key": "199f6452-6692-4338-99bb-8f98b14c0f82",
      "position": 3,
      "properties": {
        "name": "Design Your Dancer with AI",
        "progression_name": "Design"
      },
      "seeding_key": {
        "activity_section.key": "199f6452-6692-4338-99bb-8f98b14c0f82",
        "lesson_activity.key": "5471cfa4-2135-4972-aca6-c67c5aed326b"
      }
    },
    {
      "key": "0ebb25d3-4491-4eb0-95d3-c869958ce25b",
      "position": 4,
      "properties": {
        "name": "Mix Your Music with AI",
        "progression_name": "Mix"
      },
      "seeding_key": {
        "activity_section.key": "0ebb25d3-4491-4eb0-95d3-c869958ce25b",
        "lesson_activity.key": "5471cfa4-2135-4972-aca6-c67c5aed326b"
      }
    },
    {
      "key": "62c36a4f-8615-4d16-8f93-051d35b5739a",
      "position": 5,
      "properties": {
        "name": "Code Your Dance Moves with AI",
        "progression_name": "Move"
      },
      "seeding_key": {
        "activity_section.key": "62c36a4f-8615-4d16-8f93-051d35b5739a",
        "lesson_activity.key": "5471cfa4-2135-4972-aca6-c67c5aed326b"
      }
    },
    {
      "key": "57ea666f-c9f4-40f6-9b35-52c19de90ea4",
      "position": 6,
      "properties": {
        "description": "<i class=\"fa fa-check-square-o\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i> <strong>Do This:</strong>  Encourage students to click Finish when they’re done with their dance to get a link to share their projects.\n\nClicking Finish again will take students to their certificate of completion."
      },
      "seeding_key": {
        "activity_section.key": "57ea666f-c9f4-40f6-9b35-52c19de90ea4",
        "lesson_activity.key": "5471cfa4-2135-4972-aca6-c67c5aed326b"
      }
    },
    {
      "key": "0975eb14-bf16-4bec-8b26-3c6c85e9218e",
      "position": 1,
      "properties": {
        "description": " <i class=\"fa fa-microphone\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i> <strong>Say:</strong> You did it! You explored how AI can help you make code, art, and music. Today, you weren’t just using technology... you were creating with it.\n\n<i class=\"fa fa-check-square-o\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i> <strong>Do This:</strong> Choose a wrap up activity that works for your class. \n-  <i class=\"fa fa-comments\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i> <strong>Discuss:</strong> Think about what you made today. What surprised you? What would you like to explore more next time?\n\n- <i class=\"fa fa-comments\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i> <strong>Discuss:</strong> Do you think AI can be creative, or only humans? Why?\n\n-  <i class=\"fa-solid fa-pen\"></i> <strong>Write:</strong> On a sticky note, write one sentence naming your favorite part of someone else’s project.\nInclude their name.\n\n",
        "tips": [
          {
            "type": "teachingTip",
            "markdown": "Here are some alternative Wrap-Up questions. Choose the one most appropriate for your students:\n- What was your favorite thing you created with AI today?\n- What surprised you most about what AI could do?\n- What did you add that made your project different from what the AI generated?\n- Was there a moment when AI didn’t do what you expected? How did you respond?\n- If you could change one thing about how AI worked today, what would it be?\n- How would you explain what you learned today to a younger student or a parent?\n- How do you imagine AI will be used in the future — in schools, jobs, or everyday life?\n"
          }
        ]
      },
      "seeding_key": {
        "activity_section.key": "0975eb14-bf16-4bec-8b26-3c6c85e9218e",
        "lesson_activity.key": "0aff64dc-3032-47f9-b417-6794a9ed3833"
      }
    }
  ],
